  "summary": "Lightwell Security Advisory: netty-codec-stomp 4.1.100.Final-rhlw-00001",
  "details": "Red Hat Lightwell has released io.netty:netty-codec-stomp 4.1.100.Final-rhlw-00001 with backported fixes for CVE-2026-44891 and CVE-2026-59920.\n\nCVE-2026-44891: Netty: Denial of Service via Unbounded Headers in StompSubframeDecoder\n\nCVE-2026-59920: Netty: STOMP CONNECT Frame Header Injection\n\nThis patched artifact is a drop-in replacement for io.netty:netty-codec-stomp 4.1.100.Final from Maven Central.",
